		{"id":"recipe-78","type":"text","text":"**Elite Control Circuit**\nMAKE WITH: Circuit Assembler\nNEEDS: Advanced Control Circuit | Electrum Ingot |\nSignalum Ingot | OP AMP | 2 Reinforced Carbon Sheets | Processing Unit | Hydrochloric Acid","x":4980,"y":9420,"width":530,"height":171,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"recipe-79","type":"text","text":"**Ultimate Control Circuit**\nMAKE WITH: Circuit Assembler\nNEEDS: Elite Control Circuit | Refined Obsidian Ingot |\nOvercharged Crystal | 4 Reinforced Carbon Sheets | Super AI\nChip | Singularity | Cyanite Ingot","x":5630,"y":9420,"width":530,"height":198,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ae-storage-note","type":"text","text":"Requires the Circuit Assembler and the listed electronics and fluids.","x":4945,"y":6400,"width":1985,"height":65},
		{"id":"singleplayer-carbon-sheet-20261117","type":"text","text":"**Singleplayer recipes | 2026-11-17**\nImplemented locally to match the remote server; pending /reload and in-game verification.\nMI Electric Mixer: 4 Carbon Fibre Strands + 2 Deathworm Chitin (any colour) + 2,000 mB Naphtha -> 4 Reinforced Carbon Sheets. 32 EU/t, 240 ticks (12 seconds base).\nReplaces oritech:refinery/carbonsheet. Added kubejs:deathworm_chitin item tag. Removed oritech:crafting/centrifugealt.","x":600,"y":-620,"width":750,"height":350},
		{"id":"electrum-alloy-smelter-20261117","type":"text","text":"**Electrum Ingot x3**\nMAKE WITH: MI Electric Alloy Smelter (Extended Industrialization)\nNEEDS: 3 Gold Ingots | 1 Silver Ingot\n32 EU/t | 200 ticks (10 seconds base)","x":685,"y":2418,"width":600,"height":220,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"shale-oil-jei-20261117","type":"text","text":"**Shale Oil**\nMI Shale Oil fluid and bucket hidden from JEI through oil_recipes.js. Removed all four Shale Oil distillery/distillation recipes (full, 0, 1, 2). Shared output fluids remain available through other routes. Applied locally and on the remote server; pending reload and in-game verification.","x":0,"y":-470,"width":530,"height":160},
		{"id":"ae-early-note","type":"text","text":"Make the Inscriber, then its processor parts, then the network components.","x":4945,"y":5068,"width":3935,"height":65},
		{"id":"mi-conveyor-electrum-20261117","type":"text","text":"MI Conveyor\nMAKE WITH: Crafting Table or MI Assembler\nNEEDS: 2 Motors | 6 Rubber Sheets | 1 Electrum Cable","x":1335,"y":2418,"width":650,"height":260,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"recipe-adjustments-20261117","type":"text","text":"Oil and Circuits | 2026-11-17\nMI oil processing uses 1,000 mB TFMG Crude Oil. Distillery: 400 ticks at 12 EU/t; separate recipes yield 350 mB Sulfuric Light Fuel, 100 mB Sulfuric Heavy Fuel, or 200 mB Sulfuric Naphtha. Tower: 200 ticks at 36 EU/t -> 350/100/300 mB respectively plus 50 mB Helium.\nCircuit Assembler Casing: 2 Carbon Large Plates + 2 Reinforced Carbon Sheets + Mekanism Steel Casing. Elite Circuit adds 2 sheets; Ultimate Circuit uses 4 sheets.\nImplemented on client/singleplayer and server. Pending reload and runtime verification.","x":1350,"y":-620,"width":800,"height":330},
		{"id":"vss-prediction-note","type":"text","text":"**VSS settings**\nPredictive LOD disabled on the client and server. Real LOD sync remains available.","x":600,"y":-770,"width":1400,"height":150},
		{"id":"circuit-upgrades-note","type":"text","text":"Independent upgrades after their materials are available. Ultimate requires a Singularity; it is not an initial Circuit Assembler craft.","x":4940,"y":9220,"width":1335,"height":65},
		{"id":"power-alternator","type":"text","text":"**Create Alternator**\nNEEDS: Create Rotation\nOUTPUT: Electricity\nFirst power.","x":3320,"y":77,"width":530,"height":250,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"power-transition-note","type":"text","text":"**Power:** Create Alternator -> MI Assembler -> Electrical Phase -> First Generators","x":3320,"y":367,"width":2330,"height":100,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"power-mi-assembler","type":"text","text":"**MI Assembler**\nMAKE WITH: Crafting Table\nNEEDS: Robot Arm | Analog Circuit | Conveyor |\nBasic Machine Hull\nPOWER: Create Alternator","x":3920,"y":77,"width":530,"height":250,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"power-electrical-phase","type":"text","text":"**Electrical Phase**\nPowered Assembler -> First Generators","x":4520,"y":77,"width":530,"height":250,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"power-first-generators","type":"text","text":"**LV Steam Turbine**\nMAKE WITH: MI Assembler\nFUEL: Steam\nOUTPUT: Electricity","x":5120,"y":77,"width":530,"height":250,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ae-endgame-note","type":"text","text":"Tesla controller recipe not found. Survival access unverified.\nAlloy and wireless card recipes require the custom Tesla.","x":4945,"y":7960,"width":1985,"height":65}
	],
